ning recall) and mode of input (k = 34: reading, listening, reading while listening, and viewing). Next, the mean differences (i.e., learning gain scores in experimental groupslearning gain scores in control groups) were calculated per test format and used to provide an indication of learning gains MINUS practice effect.",
