        "title": "Swedish and Finnish Pre-Service Teachers’ Perceptions of Summative Assessment Practices",
        "authors": [
          "R. Hildén",
          "Anne Dragemark Oscarson",
          "A. Yıldırım",
          "Birgitta Fröjdendahl"
        ],
        "openAccessInfo": {
